                "word": "uitknobbelen",
                "pos": "verb",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0ead6afe-af07-3340-88ef-32b0e3acbb29",
                        "entry_id": "28476e8f-bbfc-3a95-b90b-6d7f8390c030",
                        "glosses": [
                            "door denken proberen een probleem oplossen"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6e3240b0-f28f-4591-982b-0eaf8d8fbb9c",
                                "sense_id": "0ead6afe-af07-3340-88ef-32b0e3acbb29",
                                "text": "De leden van atletiekvereniging ASV hebben in een algemene ledenvergadering woensdagavond gekozen voor het uitknobbelen van optimale vrijwilligersvergoedingen voor alle trainers. Een voorstel van het bestuur waarbij de huidige vergoedingen werden aangepast, in combinatie met een contributieverhoging, werd bij gebrek aan draagvlak teruggetrokken."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "296d9a81-24ef-4bd4-bfca-68e24fd7e1d3",
                                "sense_id": "0ead6afe-af07-3340-88ef-32b0e3acbb29",
                                "text": "Het plezier waarmee Wagenaar college geeft, weet hij misschien nog te overtreffen tijdens de voorstellingen die hij geeft met een van zijn circa honderdvijftig toverlantaarns. “Met de toverlantaarn kom je op veel verschillende sporen. Waar gaan die plaatjes over? Welke verhalen werden ermee uitgebeeld? En voor welk publiek? En soms moet je uitknobbelen hoe zo'n lantaarn precies werkt.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "de0b214c-32ba-4dde-86e3-e102e285a112",
                        "source_entry_id": "28476e8f-bbfc-3a95-b90b-6d7f8390c030",
                        "source_sense_id": "0ead6afe-af07-3340-88ef-32b0e3acbb29",
                        "source_sense_description": "door denken proberen een probleem oplossen",
                        "target_lang_word": "puzzle out",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "puzzle out",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a09d82f8-3b2e-34d5-bd6f-49fb36c2f51d",
                                        "entry_id": "49970db1-7fa9-39d7-a660-292bda5e4583",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To figure out; to discover or find a solution to."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c2ba135-9f78-4f87-ac8e-5031ebe8d9ca",
                                                "sense_id": "a09d82f8-3b2e-34d5-bd6f-49fb36c2f51d",
                                                "text": "[…] but Clover, who thought she remembered a definite ruling against beds, went to the end of the barn and tried to puzzle out the Seven Commandments which were inscribed there."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "537c5e30-6fcd-4c30-b5dc-7e7dabfaf87a",
                        "source_entry_id": "28476e8f-bbfc-3a95-b90b-6d7f8390c030",
                        "source_sense_id": "0ead6afe-af07-3340-88ef-32b0e3acbb29",
                        "source_sense_description": "door denken proberen een probleem oplossen",
                        "target_lang_word": "figure out",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "figure out",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "642b2691-2f77-355e-92fb-848d1ee32d6d",
                                        "entry_id": "3d5276c4-031c-3276-a9b4-0f7232b9fe6e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To come to understand; to discover or find a solution; to deduce."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3c96ff9b-bf9a-4ec9-b361-8b3bce5d71f2",
                                                "sense_id": "642b2691-2f77-355e-92fb-848d1ee32d6d",
                                                "text": "As soon as I figure out what is wrong with my car, I will fix it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "14d727b3-5310-4877-accc-b75dec0a5230",
                                                "sense_id": "642b2691-2f77-355e-92fb-848d1ee32d6d",
                                                "text": "In a bid to understand the eternal mystery that is woman, Bart goes to the least qualified possible source for advice and counsel: his father, who remarkably seems to have made it to his mid-30s without quite figuring out much of anything."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6bd9a735-0391-39b4-b8c0-f57e572e4f6e",
                                        "entry_id": "3d5276c4-031c-3276-a9b4-0f7232b9fe6e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To calculate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "018c74b4-3bbe-483c-9a61-ca9c3e8521c1",
                                                "sense_id": "6bd9a735-0391-39b4-b8c0-f57e572e4f6e",
                                                "text": "We'd already figured out that the trip would cost $1,000."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
